#. i18n: file: kmymoney/wizards/newaccountwizard/kloandetailspagedecl.ui:126
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIntSpinBox, m_termAmount)
#: rc.cpp:4334
msgid ""
"Please enter the term of this loan or enter 0 to calculate it. The term is "
"the time that is required to fully repay the loan. This time might be "
"different from the time your loan contract is signed for."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file: kmymoney/wizards/newaccountwizard/kloandetailspagedecl.ui:138
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel11)
